  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective labour market governance depends on the presence of strong, independent, and democratic employers&apos; and workers&apos; organizations, supported by robust, accountable, and inclusive labour administration systems. 
The ILO continues to strengthen the capacity of the Chamber of Commerce and Industry Timor-Leste (CCI-TL) and the Hospitality and Tourism Association of Timor-Leste (HOTL), enabling them to better serve both current and prospective members, and to play a more impactful role in shaping socio-economic policies and labour governance. During this biennium, the ILO provides support through organizational reviews, strategic planning, capability assessments, and human resource development initiatives aimed at enhancing their institutional effectiveness</narrative>
  </description>
